WEBVTT

00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:46.003
Here she comes!

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:46.703
Too slow!

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.473
Hornet Blaster!

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.700
Blue Explosion!

00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:12.233
Just what you'd expect
from Blue Dragon.

00:02:12.433 --> 00:02:13.803
I suppose.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.770
Well then, I guess I'll use a bit
more of the Darkness power.

00:02:27.566 --> 00:02:28.226
What is that?!

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.296
That's...

00:02:48.233 --> 00:02:48.903
Zola...

00:02:49.533 --> 00:02:54.433
SHU

00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:11.873
Maro...

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:13.533
That's Zola.

00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:14.503
No.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.270
That's Killer Bat!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.330
Were you able to see it?

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.370
No.

00:03:38.866 --> 00:03:42.666
Basically, they're in
a league of their own.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.770
L-Look!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.930
It's coming from behind us, too!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.500
We've been surrounded
by the Darkness!

00:04:19.533 --> 00:04:20.633
Mom...

00:04:20.866 --> 00:04:23.126
What's going to happen to us?

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.630
Close your eyes if you're scared.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.270
We'll always be together.

00:04:50.733 --> 00:04:51.973
Conquer!

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.870
Maro!

00:05:03.633 --> 00:05:05.433
Gungnir Rising!

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.930
We're going, too.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:16.770
Right!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:20.470
Shu...

00:05:21.433 --> 00:05:23.233
We'll do our best, too!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.170
He's battling an opponent
that powerful

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.630
and is holding his own.

00:05:34.366 --> 00:05:35.366
That kid...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.230
It's as if he's become
a different person

00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:38.696
since the Darkness
absorbed him.

00:05:40.066 --> 00:05:43.966
Did something happen to Shu...
in the Darkness?

00:05:44.366 --> 00:05:45.926
Happen, happen!

00:05:46.066 --> 00:05:47.666
The only thing we need
to concern ourselves

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.430
with now is sealing
the Darkness.

00:05:49.933 --> 00:05:50.603
Let's hurry!

00:05:52.433 --> 00:05:53.473
He's sure calm.

00:06:12.266 --> 00:06:14.466
Blue Explosion!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:35.500
You're pretty good...

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:38.273
However, this space belongs
to the Darkness.

00:06:38.566 --> 00:06:40.666
I won't be defeated so easily.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:45.570
Not only that,
I am the Darkness itself.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:50.830
As long as I'm here,
I can get even stronger.

00:07:05.733 --> 00:07:07.203
What the hell is that?!

00:07:07.766 --> 00:07:09.226
It's the Darkness itself...

00:07:09.766 --> 00:07:11.226
The Darkness itself?!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.170
In other words,

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.800
it can tap into unlimited power
as long as it's in here.

00:07:17.466 --> 00:07:18.766
I think you're right.

00:07:18.966 --> 00:07:20.696
What do we do, Marumaro?

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.300
Maro...

00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:24.196
Be inquisitive later!

00:07:24.533 --> 00:07:26.573
But Shu's in danger, maro.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:30.670
As soon as that battle is over,
we'll start sealing the Darkness.

00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:33.103
We're going to prepare for that.

00:07:33.633 --> 00:07:34.633
But...

00:07:34.966 --> 00:07:37.296
It seems you're
not seeing anything.

00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:38.003
What?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.200
The Darkness may have
taken a different form,

00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:43.703
but the tables have not turned.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.100
That's right!

00:07:51.466 --> 00:07:52.866
Hang in there, Shu!

00:07:53.166 --> 00:07:53.826
Let's go!

00:07:54.266 --> 00:07:54.926
Right!

00:07:54.966 --> 00:07:55.626
Yeah!

00:08:00.633 --> 00:08:01.703
What's the matter?

00:08:02.066 --> 00:08:04.526
Are you so scared
you can't even talk?

00:08:04.866 --> 00:08:08.296
You must be a fool.
Is that really how it looks to you?

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.800
What?

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:14.270
Your form may have changed.
But we remain the same!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:19.130
For the people I must protect,
and the people I couldn't protect...

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.870
For my dear friends,
and this entire world...

00:08:23.466 --> 00:08:25.966
And for our future...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.600
My goal remains the same.

00:08:29.633 --> 00:08:33.933
I came this far to
stop the sadness!

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:37.570
- We've been ready for this forever!
- We've been ready for this forever!

00:09:13.066 --> 00:09:15.266
Zola, I figured it out!

00:09:15.966 --> 00:09:19.826
I figured out that power
lies in people's hearts,

00:09:19.866 --> 00:09:22.596
and that it can overcome
anything in their way!

00:09:32.766 --> 00:09:34.966
The Soldiers of Light
from long ago...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.270
They didn't win
their battle by surprise.

00:09:38.066 --> 00:09:40.466
Those Shadow Wielders
were able to

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.200
defeat the Darkness because
they had hearts!

00:09:43.233 --> 00:09:44.603
They had feelings!

00:09:45.366 --> 00:09:48.466
It's the reason why
we'll never lose!

00:10:01.533 --> 00:10:03.073
Blue Explosion!

00:10:11.433 --> 00:10:12.433
Did they beat it?!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.830
No, not yet.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.470
No way... Did he?!

00:10:20.633 --> 00:10:22.203
Did he! Did he!

00:10:22.766 --> 00:10:24.926
Did he miss on purpose?

00:10:25.533 --> 00:10:26.203
Shu...

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:32.533
I see. I get it now...

00:10:32.833 --> 00:10:35.373
This is what you want, right?

00:10:51.866 --> 00:10:53.366
Eternal Breath!

00:10:56.733 --> 00:10:57.733
Zola!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.270
Shu...

00:11:26.166 --> 00:11:27.666
Can you do it, Shu?!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.100
Go, Shu!

00:11:33.533 --> 00:11:36.803
I told you...that we are ready!

00:11:37.333 --> 00:11:38.003
Zola...

00:11:38.666 --> 00:11:39.896
Can you hear me?!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:40.970
Zola!

00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:42.333
I will!

00:11:42.633 --> 00:11:43.633
I will!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.930
I will stop you as a friend!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.870
I will stop you as a friend!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.470
Zola!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.700
Shu!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.770
Zola!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:31.800
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:12:38.266 --> 00:12:40.826
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:12:50.233 --> 00:12:51.603
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:13:00.266 --> 00:13:00.926
Zola!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.330
What're you doing?!

00:13:03.566 --> 00:13:06.666
We don't have time!
Get into the sealing position!

00:13:07.033 --> 00:13:10.073
We have to hurry, or the whole world
will be absorbed by the Darkness!

00:13:12.133 --> 00:13:13.203
Hurry, Shu!

00:13:22.133 --> 00:13:23.133
You ready?

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.370
Shut up.

00:13:24.766 --> 00:13:26.026
Just do it.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:32.800
Concentrate, everyone.
We will seal up the Darkness.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.900
What?! What's going on?!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.470
Why?!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.800
Why can't we seal up the Darkness?

00:14:03.433 --> 00:14:06.133
It seems it is our victory,
after all...

00:14:06.666 --> 00:14:07.866
You fools.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:13.400
You can't seal the Darkness
as easily as closing a door.

00:14:13.733 --> 00:14:16.273
You guys were too late.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.500
This whole world will
soon become ours.

00:14:20.666 --> 00:14:23.766
Then I will destroy
this Sealed Grounds

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.530
so you will never be able to
seal the Darkness, ever.

00:14:29.366 --> 00:14:31.066
What a pity.

00:14:31.333 --> 00:14:32.803
You've won the battle,

00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:35.473
but the Darkness
will rule the world.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:41.270
In time, I will come back.
And I will destroy you all.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.530
Don't give up!

00:14:44.033 --> 00:14:44.703
Shu...

00:14:45.466 --> 00:14:50.626
If we pour in all of our power,
we can still make it in time!

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:51.770
Hurry!

00:14:52.166 --> 00:14:53.166
Okay.

00:14:54.966 --> 00:14:57.426
Maro!

00:15:09.433 --> 00:15:11.103
It's futile.

00:15:11.366 --> 00:15:12.666
No, it's not!

00:15:13.166 --> 00:15:17.996
If we pour in our hearts and souls,

00:15:18.033 --> 00:15:20.703
we can make
the impossible possible!

00:15:28.633 --> 00:15:29.673
Phoenix?!

00:15:34.933 --> 00:15:35.933
What's this?!

00:15:39.033 --> 00:15:40.473
Our Shadows are vanishing?!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.700
Boss Lady...

00:15:43.166 --> 00:15:44.166
Hippo!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.500
Stay strong!

00:15:45.733 --> 00:15:46.403
Huh?!

00:15:46.766 --> 00:15:48.696
We will fail if we waver!

00:15:49.233 --> 00:15:51.503
What do you mean by that, maro?!

00:15:51.566 --> 00:15:57.026
We must use all of our Shadow powers
to seal the Darkness!

00:15:57.066 --> 00:15:58.296
But that means!

00:15:58.733 --> 00:15:59.803
Boss Lady!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.130
Hippo!

00:16:02.866 --> 00:16:05.596
It's as he says!

00:16:05.633 --> 00:16:07.773
No way! That means...

00:16:08.433 --> 00:16:11.573
That means,
this is goodbye, Hippo?!

00:16:11.666 --> 00:16:12.726
Phoenix...

00:16:13.533 --> 00:16:16.433
Kluke, you need to concentrate now.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.500
Right!

00:16:19.066 --> 00:16:21.896
It appears this is
our last big moment.

00:16:22.366 --> 00:16:24.166
Saber Tiger...

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.770
Marumaro, thank you for everything.

00:16:29.866 --> 00:16:31.896
Maro...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.230
Jeez, everyone's so emotional.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.830
This is it!
Let's settle this right, partner!

00:16:49.166 --> 00:16:50.766
Did you know this would happen, Shu?!

00:16:51.933 --> 00:16:55.773
We just... We just have to do this!

00:16:55.833 --> 00:16:57.233
That's right!

00:16:57.966 --> 00:17:01.996
Get fired up, guys!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.930
We'll never give up!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.200
Zola!

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.270
Mom...

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.270
Hey! Look at that!

00:18:48.266 --> 00:18:49.266
The Darkness...

00:18:49.533 --> 00:18:51.203
It's vanishing!

00:19:29.266 --> 00:19:32.226
Zola, now you're...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.670
You're going?

00:19:55.666 --> 00:19:57.566
I'm not good with sappy stuff.

00:19:58.133 --> 00:19:59.533
Everyone will miss you.

00:20:01.633 --> 00:20:02.333
Hey, Shu...

00:20:02.866 --> 00:20:03.526
Yeah?

00:20:03.966 --> 00:20:07.766
We exchanged our Shadow powers
to seal the Darkness...

00:20:08.333 --> 00:20:09.003
Yeah...

00:20:09.633 --> 00:20:11.203
And you're okay with that?

00:20:12.033 --> 00:20:14.133
Didn't you have a lot of stuff
you wanted to say to him?

00:20:15.133 --> 00:20:17.333
I'm sure Blue Dragon
would understand

00:20:17.366 --> 00:20:18.926
without me having to
say anything.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:22.830
In the end,
what did we really accomplish?

00:20:23.766 --> 00:20:26.926
We did save the world,

00:20:26.966 --> 00:20:30.726
but it doesn't mean
all the problems are gone...

00:20:31.766 --> 00:20:32.766
Don't worry.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:38.330
Zola said the world evolved
in the wrong direction, right?

00:20:38.966 --> 00:20:39.626
Yeah.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.730
It wasn't wrong.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:47.230
The fact that we're standing here
right now is the answer to it,

00:20:47.266 --> 00:20:48.596
don't you think?

00:20:49.666 --> 00:20:50.866
Evolution, huh?

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.600
What?

00:20:54.133 --> 00:20:57.533
I never thought I'd hear
something like that from you.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.070
Shut up.

00:21:01.033 --> 00:21:02.433
Thanks for everything.

00:21:03.233 --> 00:21:04.733
Yeah, same here.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:05.970
Bye.

00:21:07.666 --> 00:21:11.496
Are you really going?
Why don't you just stay with us?

00:21:11.866 --> 00:21:12.526
Sorry.

00:21:13.966 --> 00:21:16.666
But I want to have some time alone

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:20.900
and think about what I should do
now that I don't have a Shadow.

00:21:26.733 --> 00:21:29.103
I see. Good luck.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:32.700
You, too.

00:21:45.266 --> 00:21:46.266
Shu...

00:21:47.566 --> 00:21:50.666
What will you do
if you possess power?
